<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 25-0 V AUSTRALIA (243) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 25-0 V AUSTRALIA (243) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, replying to Austalia's first innings 243 all out, were 25 without loss at the close on the first day of the fifth and final test at the WACA on Saturday.</p>
</text>
